  "purpose" : "(Clinical Focus: This value set contains concepts the provide information regarding a specimen, including the container, that does not meet a laboratory’s criteria for acceptability.),(Data Element Scope: This set of values may include information about the contents of the container, the container, and the label.),(Inclusion Criteria: Selected concepts decending from 441742003 | Evaluation finding (finding) | that do not conceptually overlap with concepts in http://terminology.hl7.org/ValueSet/v2-0493),(Exclusion Criteria: Concepts that overlap with concepts in http://terminology.hl7.org/ValueSet/v2-0493)",
